{
  "$comment": "Permission allow-list for an unattended /issue-to-pr run (docs/benchmark/unattended-run.md, pre-flight check 6). Pass it explicitly with: claude --settings .claude/issue-to-pr.settings.json -p \"/issue-to-pr #<n>\". It is the union of the per-stage allow-lists in skills/issue-to-pr/agents/*.md section 2; the per-stage limits inside it stay prompt-level. It is deliberately not .claude/settings.json, so interactive sessions of the team are not restricted by the deny list.",
